  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stationary mass of 1 kg is pulled along a frictionless 3 m inclined plane by a constant force of 6 N. At the top of the plane the mass has been displaced 1 m vertically.<br/><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the mass at the top of the incline?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">3 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">4 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">6 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">18 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
